# Generated by python -m ridge.deck_narrative --write. Scenario wording is
# rendered from assets/scenario-narrative-v1.json; do not retype it here.
pageType: content
audience: participant
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 16]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: PART 1 · THE INCIDENT}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 66, 832, 34]
    content: {style: "$title", fontSize: 30, wrap: false, text: "Four things that are urgent, and what urgent means here"}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 116, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 832,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: start-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 144, 396, 151]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: start-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 158, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: THE START WINDOW}
  - elementId: start-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [78, 182, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: start-timeframe
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 194, 368, 18]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.timeframe
    content: {style: "$body", fontSize: 13, lineHeight: 1.4, text: "<p>Orientation, then the first look at the network record</p>"}
  - elementId: start-urgency
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 220, 368, 59]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.urgency
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>High and bounded. Nothing downstream is worth doing until you can describe the transfer in one sentence that a stranger could check.</p>
  - elementId: preserve-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 144, 396, 151]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: preserve-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 158, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$slate", wrap: false, text: PRESERVE WHAT IS THERE}
  - elementId: preserve-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [514, 182, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: preserve-no_operational_detail
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 194, 368, 59]
    contractRef: boundaries.no_operational_detail
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>The exercise contains no procedure for gaining access to anything, and none will be provided. The tools are used to read records, not to act on them.</p>
  - elementId: own-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 295, 396, 171]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: own-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 309, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: OWN THE TICKET}
  - elementId: own-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [78, 333, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: own-handoff
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 345, 368, 59]
    contractRef: ticket_complete.handoff
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>Hand the question and the evidence path to whoever picks up the shared case next, and say plainly what you could not establish.</p>
  - elementId: own-credit
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 412, 368, 38]
    contractRef: accepted.credit
    content: {style: "$body", fontSize: 13, lineHeight: 1.4, text: "<p>One point. Points are per team and survive a ticket changing hands.</p>"}
  - elementId: escalate-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 295, 396, 125]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: escalate-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 309, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$slate", wrap: false, text: "ESCALATE, DO NOT STALL"}
  - elementId: escalate-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [514, 333, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: escalate-no_credentials
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 345, 368, 59]
    contractRef: boundaries.no_credentials
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>No credential, address, key or infrastructure detail is displayed to participants at any point. If a screen appears to show one, that is a defect: report it to the operator.</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 15]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "#7E877F", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 15]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "#7E877F", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "5"}
